ode_id":"U_kgDOCoJICA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176310280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio","html_url":"https://github.com/moongdevstudio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moongdevstudio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-09T12:03:14Z","updated_at":"2025-05-09T12:03:14Z","body":"> Does this happen on previous stable version?\n\nNope 4.4.1 doesn't have this issue at all\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2866284300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2866687878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106185#issuecomment-2866687878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106185","id":2866687878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6q3i-G","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-09T14:06:59Z","updated_at":"2025-05-09T14:37:07Z","body":"This is likely a performance regression from #104269 - the 3D physics interpolation has been completely rewritten and works in totally different way.\n\nI checked and although present in master, it is not actually present in 4.5 dev 3 (the PR above was merged _after_ dev 3), so I'll correct the OPs post.\n\nI'm _expecting_ performance regressions with high numbers of objects in the scene tree, as the original PR takes the naive approach of traversing the entire tree, and leaves optimization to follow up (this is mentioned on the PR).\n\nThe main optimization is in #105728, which only updates branches that have changed, and I'll be adding that soon for 4.x. If I can replicate the MRP I can test whether the problem is solved in 3.x with the existing changes.\n\nI'll also profile it to double check the bottleneck is where I suspect. There's also a minor optimization in #105901 but I doubt that will be the causing this.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37a459b8-bd0d-49e2-9e7a-a22b7f848a0f)\n\nUPDATE:\nYes profiling confirms it's the scene tree traversal for the whole tree. This seems particularly expensive in master due to some changes for dealing with multi-thread access, it's a lot lighter in 3.x. Even calls like `get_child_count()`. But it's likely this can be alleviated.\n\nAnyway the main regression should be fixed with #105728 for 4.x.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2866687878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]